{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786870/extras/Elroy_Steam_Artbook_Render_2D_PDF.png?t=1754566874\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>The Art of </i>Elroy and the Aliens</strong> is a comprehensive visual look at the game's creation, from start to finish. This <i>digital Artbook</i> touches upon the development of the characters, backgrounds, and storytelling. In its pages, you will find early pencil sketches, digital paintings, character design, frame-by-frame animations, and more. It's accompanied by stories and anecdotes behind the game's production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Added is also a whole section that talks about and shows the first two versions of the game, how it was, how it evolved, and all the art that ended up on the cutting floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is written and designed by the main artist behind the game \u2013 Urban Breznik Corbillon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>[Format: One 100+ page &amp; one 200+ page PDF | Language: English | Download location: Root game folder on your PC (Right click on game in Steam library &gt; Manage &gt; Browse local files)]</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786870/extras/Artobook-Flip-page-GIF_Steam.gif?t=1754566874\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786870/extras/Seperators_ENG_Sketch-to-screen_000_english.png?t=1754566874\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786870/extras/Screenshots_Book_001.png?t=1754566874\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class